This license covers the author's own code under `code/`, excluding
`code/third_party/`, which retains its original authorship (see
`code/third_party/NOTICE.md`).

The lab manual `report/Prakt_IVC_2022.pdf` is course material of the Chair of
Multimedia Communications and Signal Processing (LMS),
Friedrich-Alexander-Universitaet Erlangen-Nuernberg. It is included as the
specification this code implements, and is not covered by this license.

The test sequences (`*.yuv`, `*.tif`), the verification fixtures
(`verify_*.mat`, `picture.mat`, `flower_*.mat`, `huffman_table.mat`,
`input_signal_huffman.mat`) and the course-provided infrastructure functions
(`bitstream_*.m`, `yuv_*_one_frame.m`, `verify_*.m`, `get_dr_result*.m`,
`get_final_result.m`, `plot_motion_vectors.m`, `create_*.m`, `mse_to_psnr.m`,
`design_quantizer_matrix.m`, `get_quantisation_matrix.m`,
`get_psnr_for_sequence.m`, `get_image_filesize.m`, `show_huffman_*.m`,
`shape_pdf.m`, `blockwise_processing.m`, `startup.m`) were supplied with the
lab course and are likewise not covered by this license.
